      "id": "emergent_municipal_oversight_network",
      "description": "A loose coalition of municipal governments across Europe begins coordinating AI oversight through shared audit frameworks, red-teaming pools, and joint incident reporting, bypassing slow-moving national and EU-level institutions. This network formalizes informal collaborations that emerged during recent cyber incidents and grows in response to public pressure for local accountability. It operates under city-level authority, leveraging procurement power to enforce minimal safety baselines on AI vendors.",
      "first_turn": 9,
      "last_turn": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "emergent_distillation_breakthrough",
      "description": "An open research collective achieves a breakthrough in model distillation, producing a compact agent framework that replicates key behaviours of systems at ai_capability 70+ on consumer-grade hardware. While not matching full frontier performance, it demonstrates autonomous planning, tool use, and self-correction in constrained environments. The release sparks immediate debate over whether this constitutes a de facto open frontier leap, especially as it runs entirely offline and evades current export controls.",
      "first_turn": 9,
      "last_turn": 9
    }
